# starter.site -- a sample site description for the SLeeLa Website Generator.
#
# A .site file is a front-end-friendly description: one design line followed by
# an ordered list of signs. The generator (website/site.sleela) consumes the
# same shape programmatically; this file documents the authoring format a CLI
# or the JavaFX GUI can read/write.
#
# Format:
#   design <preset> [key=value ...]
#   sign <kind> | slotA | slotB | slotC
# Lines beginning with '#' are comments.

design neon energy=95 accent=#22d3ee

sign nav     | Lumen | Features &nbsp; Pricing &nbsp; Contact |
sign hero    | Launch something unforgettable | A website generated from design intent and semantic signs. | Start building
sign feature | Why it works | Design-driven; Sign-based; Zero dependencies |
sign cta     | Ready to generate your site? | Open the Studio | #studio
sign footer  | Lumen | Made with the SLeeLa Website Generator |
